{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55658","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 五十六 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 五十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"野景陶情皆得意，凡夫举目尽堪愁。\n秦川几度埋番骨，棘路还曾耸玉楼。\n幻体不知波上沫，狂心须认镜中头。\n浮生役役贪荣者，求到真空卒未休。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55658.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55658","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}